.TH FERITTO 1 "2026-11-03" "feritto" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
feritto \- native X11 and Wayland clipboard history manager
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B feritto
.RI [ OPTION ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
feritto captures clipboard history and provides a searchable desktop popup.
It supports text, PNG images, HTML, RTF and file lists.
The service runs as the logged-in desktop user and keeps running when the popup
is hidden. With no option, feritto starts or shows the popup.
.PP
Run feritto from an X11 or Wayland desktop session, not as root.
Wayland capture requires a compositor implementing ext-data-control-v1 or
wlr-data-control. GNOME Wayland does not provide these protocols.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-daemon
Start with the popup hidden.
.TP
.B \-\-show
Show the popup.
.TP
.B \-\-toggle
Toggle the popup. The default X11 shortcut is Ctrl+grave.
On Wayland, configure a compositor shortcut if no GlobalShortcuts portal exists.
.TP
.B \-\-hide
Hide the popup.
.TP
.B \-\-settings
Open settings.
.TP
.B \-\-pause
Toggle capture pause.
.TP
.B \-\-status
Print capabilities and history count as JSON.
.TP
.BR \-\-list " [" \-\-search " " QUERY ]
List up to 1000 clip summaries as JSON, optionally filtered by a search query.
.TP
.BI \-\-copy " ID"
Put a historical clip on the clipboard.
.TP
.BI \-\-paste " ID"
Copy a historical clip and request paste into the active window.
.TP
.BI \-\-add " TEXT"
Add a text clip to history.
.TP
.B \-\-add-stdin
Add UTF-8 text from standard input, up to 32 MiB.
.TP
.BI \-\-delete " ID"
Delete one history entry.
.TP
.B \-\-clear-history
Delete all history and keep the current clipboard.
.TP
.B \-\-clear-clipboard
Clear the clipboard and keep history.
.TP
.B \-\-quit
Stop the service.
.TP
.BR \-\-help ", " \-h
Show command-line help.
.TP
.BR \-\-version ", " \-V
Print the version.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_DATA_HOME/feritto
Unencrypted clipboard history. Defaults to ~/.local/share/feritto.
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/feritto/settings.json
Settings. Defaults to ~/.config/feritto/settings.json.
.TP
.I $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/feritto
Per-user instance socket. Without XDG_RUNTIME_DIR, a private directory under
/tmp is used.
.TP
.I /usr/share/doc/feritto/io.github.gh2302.Feritto-autostart.desktop
Optional autostart example. Copy into ~/.config/autostart/ to enable it.
Package installation does not enable autostart or start the application.
.SH PRIVACY
History is unencrypted. Pause capture before copying sensitive content.
Deleting history is logical deletion, not secure erasure of backups or
filesystem snapshots.
Removing the package leaves user history and settings intact.
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR /usr/share/doc/feritto/README.md ,
.I /usr/share/doc/feritto/README.Debian
